おいて損はないっすね、、、","ts":"1628260282.184700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1zKlR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"774bbf08-4310-4859-97f8-6b9ccbfdb153","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"(条項の)1つも違反せずに利用することができなくなる、って書いてありました。","ts":"1628260246.184000","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628260268.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dTCzB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cfc24888-483e-4d75-8bb1-7c941ebaec89","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"おそらく。。","ts":"1628260230.183500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XuMf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"358c85d0-3760-4365-9450-dcbd9df0f20a","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"（想定する意味があるかわからないけど）コンフリクトした場合、\n依存ライブラリを公開するのは合法だけど誰も利用することができない、\nみたいな状態になりますか？","ts":"1628260218.183200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kTb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db47a099-16ba-498d-a483-3d8431c82284","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"MPL1.1とGPLはダメらしい。","ts":"1628260162.182500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OKR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"903063d7-f6f0-45fb-af2a-bcf0023b4e78","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あー、なるほど難しい","ts":"1628260152.182200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4nsgl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"209ba77f-c606-4761-b596-7c51e695a52a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一部コンフリクトする例が挙げられてますね。","ts":"1628260131.181800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ErbB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05f95da6-eb6d-4d0e-81bb-dedf006b354b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; Many of the most common free-software licenses, especially the permissive licenses, such as the original MIT/X license, BSD licenses (in the three-clause and two-clause forms, though not the original four-clause form), MPL 2.0, and LGPL, are GPL-compatible.","ts":"1628260099.181300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qe1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a78177ec-d5b8-4917-a27e-28088fc4312a","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"GPLは極端な例として出してみました・・・","ts":"1628260045.181100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yzs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b7ae596-74c4-42a3-abb0-19b161c5101b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"使う側がそうなるのでこの場合だとMITにする意味もあんまないですが、\nとりあえず依存する側は依存先のライセンスに関係なく自由に決められる、で合ってますかね？","ts":"1628260020.180800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sadV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6c341e5-358e-43cd-b560-606a30ab5752","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"使う方は自動的により厳しいGPLに従うことになるから…","ts":"1628259960.179900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kFQBw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fe5cbb4-f002-4a98-8bdc-ade6df14ae8d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一応、互換であるという研究(?)はあるみたい。","ts":"1628259928.179300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WJ1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9478ae41-b7bb-4d86-bb9a-f4141670bb14","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"そうなんすよね。","ts":"1628259871.178600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9=dE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06585cc4-d178-44e2-a5fb-9d51c7b88ec2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/License_compatibility\u003e","ts":"1628259858.178300","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: License compatibility","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/","title":"License compatibility","title_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/License_compatibility","text":"License compatibility is a legal framework that allows for pieces of software with different software licenses to be distributed together. The need for such a framework arises because the different licenses can contain contradictory requirements, rendering it impossible to legally combine source code from separately-licensed software in order to create and publish a new program. Proprietary licenses are generally program-specific and incompatible; authors must negotiate to combine code. Copyleft licenses are deliberately incompatible with proprietary licenses, in order to prevent copyleft software from being re-licensed under a proprietary license, turning it into proprietary software. Many copyleft licenses explicitly allow relicensing under some other copyleft licenses. Permissive licenses are (with minor exceptions) compatible with everything, including proprietary licenses; there is thus no guarantee that all derived works will remain under a permissive license.","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/License_compatibility","original_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/License_compatibility"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7fm7I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edf9f98a-150c-4339-b9c0-2f127b3e014b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"MITのほうが緩いからなぁ…","ts":"1628259746.178000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"53707"}]},{"client_msg_id":"582f1b9b-e39b-442e-adba-531738fbd4fe","type":"message","user":"U